---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact | FULL TIME" description="Get in touch with the FULL TIME team for corrections, editorial enquiries, or partnership discussions.">
  <main style="max-width:740px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.25rem 4rem;">
    <h1 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Contact</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--c-muted);margin-bottom:2rem;">We read every message.</p>

    <p>The best way to reach us is by email. We aim to respond within 48 hours.</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Editorial</h2>
    <p>Corrections, factual disputes, story tips, or article suggestions: <a href="mailto:benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com">benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com</a></p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">Partnerships and advertising</h2>
    <p>For advertising, sponsorship, or content partnership enquiries, contact us at the same address with the subject line "Partnership".</p>

    <h2 style="font-family:'Anton',sans-serif;margin-top:2rem;">General</h2>
    <p>For anything else, email us at <a href="mailto:benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com">benjamingathukumuthoni@gmail.com</a> and we will get back to you.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--c-muted);font-size:0.9rem;">FULL TIME is operated by Bengamu Technology Solutions, Nairobi, Kenya.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
